{"id": "34815", "title": "甄宓传", "author": "徐潇", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 64, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34815/34815s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34815.htm", "intro": "离奇的毕业旅行，意外地将沁馨带到群雄纷争的三国时代，摇身一变成为河北第一美女甄宓。河北有甄氏，江南有二乔，她们都是当时最著名的绝世佳人。战火连连的年代，甄宓相继邂逅了雄霸天下的曹氏父子。曹操，一代枭雄，奸狡诡谲，为了她不惜屠城，可他对甄宓的喜欢类似于对花瓶的收藏。曹丕，一代霸主，称雄半壁，却始终钟爱她一人。曹植，一代才子，文采无双，为了她写出流传千古的《洛神赋》。在华佗的帮助下，甄宓离开曹家，她想离开这个帝王之家、这个纠纷之地。八年后，甄宓再次返回曹家，但是爱与恨还在继续着、升华着……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34815", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2258084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2258085.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2258086.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2258087.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2258088.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2258089.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2258090.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2258091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2258092.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2258093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2258094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2258095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2258096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2258097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2258098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2258099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2258100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2258101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2258102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2258103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2258104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2258105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2258106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2258107.html"